WEBVTT

00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:13.399
-We should go.
-[low growling]

00:00:13.608 --> 00:00:14.817
[both] Oh, no!

00:00:18.196 --> 00:00:20.073
[growling]

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:21.574
[roaring loudly]

00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:26.996
[Astrid] Stormfly.

00:00:28.164 --> 00:00:29.582
[both grunting]

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:32.210
[Toothless calling]

00:00:33.878 --> 00:00:34.963
[squawks]

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.174
[grunting]

00:00:40.635 --> 00:00:43.054
[Hiccup screams]

00:00:44.639 --> 00:00:46.140
Go! Go!

00:00:53.606 --> 00:00:54.899
[both panting]

00:00:57.944 --> 00:00:59.570
I... I'm sorry, bud. I... I just...

00:00:59.654 --> 00:01:01.072
[Toothless roars]

00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:06.494
[Stormfly squawks]

00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:20.133
[quiet sniffling]

00:01:23.303 --> 00:01:24.387
[grunts softly]

00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:26.014
Son.

00:01:28.141 --> 00:01:29.350
You should be asleep.

00:01:30.101 --> 00:01:31.394
I was thirsty.

00:01:33.354 --> 00:01:34.689
[sighs]

00:01:35.398 --> 00:01:36.649
Yeah, come here.

00:01:48.953 --> 00:01:50.204
Dad?

00:01:50.288 --> 00:01:53.541
Are you gonna get us a new mom?

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.209
[Stoick sighs]

00:01:56.961 --> 00:01:58.254
I don't want another.

00:01:58.713 --> 00:02:02.091
Your mom was the only woman for me.

00:02:03.092 --> 00:02:04.719
She was the love of my life.

00:02:07.555 --> 00:02:10.558
But with love comes loss, son.

00:02:11.893 --> 00:02:13.436
It's part of the deal.

00:02:13.519 --> 00:02:16.439
Sometimes it hurts, but, in the end,

00:02:17.357 --> 00:02:18.733
it's all worth it.

00:02:21.152 --> 00:02:23.696
There's no greater gift than love.

00:02:24.906 --> 00:02:26.366
[sighs]

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.956
[groaning sadly]

00:02:49.305 --> 00:02:51.015
[deep groaning]

00:03:00.233 --> 00:03:01.776
[groans sadly]

00:03:03.403 --> 00:03:04.821
[sighs]

00:03:06.864 --> 00:03:08.366
It's okay, bud.

00:03:09.242 --> 00:03:11.452
You belong there, with her.

00:03:13.371 --> 00:03:14.539
We don't.

00:03:15.123 --> 00:03:16.833
[grunts softly]

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.085
And that's all right.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.672
-We'll find a way to--
-[dragon calls in distance]

00:03:22.755 --> 00:03:24.048
[grunts]

00:03:27.176 --> 00:03:28.177
[grunts happily]

00:03:32.014 --> 00:03:33.182
Hey!

00:03:33.266 --> 00:03:34.642
[laughs]

00:03:35.309 --> 00:03:36.811
She followed us back.

00:03:38.563 --> 00:03:41.107
[both purring happily]

00:03:42.442 --> 00:03:45.069
We might not have
to say goodbye after all.

00:03:49.866 --> 00:03:52.201
[both purring]

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.828
That's it.

00:03:53.911 --> 00:03:55.663
[Ruffnut] Whoo-hoo! Yeah! [laughs]

00:03:55.746 --> 00:03:57.540
-Ruffnut?
-Miss me?

00:03:57.623 --> 00:03:59.167
How did you escape?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.793
I annoyed them till they let me go.

00:04:00.877 --> 00:04:02.420
-[Ruffnut laughs]
-Wait. Wait.

00:04:02.503 --> 00:04:04.046
Grimmel let you go?

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.506
[Ruffnut] So dumb.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.508
They couldn't handle me.

00:04:07.592 --> 00:04:09.552
See, everyone thinks
Tuffnut's more annoying, but...

00:04:09.635 --> 00:04:11.888
-But... hold on.
-Ruffnut, focus.

00:04:11.971 --> 00:04:13.139
Were you followed?

00:04:13.806 --> 00:04:15.766
I never look back, Hiccup.

00:04:15.975 --> 00:04:17.894
[gasps] Toothless!

00:04:19.812 --> 00:04:22.565
-Toothless!
-[sniffs and roars]

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:26.444
[squeals]

00:04:27.528 --> 00:04:28.613
[growls]

00:04:31.574 --> 00:04:33.326
Toothless, come back!

00:04:37.955 --> 00:04:39.165
[growls]

00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:41.792
[roars]

00:04:41.876 --> 00:04:42.835
No!

00:04:46.672 --> 00:04:48.925
[dragons squawking]

00:05:00.228 --> 00:05:03.731
And now our little game
must come to an end.

00:05:04.732 --> 00:05:06.776
[dragons roaring]

00:05:08.986 --> 00:05:10.071
Call them off, Alpha.

00:05:10.821 --> 00:05:13.491
No reason for her to die, too.

00:05:18.412 --> 00:05:19.372
[grunts]

00:05:21.123 --> 00:05:22.291
[roars]

00:05:24.001 --> 00:05:25.670
[roaring stops]

00:05:27.296 --> 00:05:28.339
What are they doing?

00:05:28.422 --> 00:05:29.715
They could totally take him.

00:05:29.799 --> 00:05:31.634
Not with her life on the line.

00:05:32.969 --> 00:05:34.845
[Toothless roaring]

00:05:35.096 --> 00:05:36.514
Save your breath.

00:05:36.597 --> 00:05:39.767
The only alpha they respond to is me.

00:05:40.726 --> 00:05:41.978
[groaning]

00:05:45.022 --> 00:05:46.607
-[sighs]
-[Grimmel] Aw...

00:05:46.816 --> 00:05:50.027
Don't feel too badly. You tried your best.

00:05:50.111 --> 00:05:54.407
But you are nothing without your dragon.

00:05:54.615 --> 00:05:56.492
-[whistles]
-[dragons growl]

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.083
[calls]

00:06:04.417 --> 00:06:06.210
[dragons calling]

00:06:10.256 --> 00:06:11.591
[Hiccup] Toothless!

00:06:16.053 --> 00:06:17.597
[panting]

00:06:18.139 --> 00:06:20.308
[dragons calling]

00:06:29.025 --> 00:06:32.612
Oh, that is just... [groans] Great.
Now what?

00:06:32.695 --> 00:06:35.823
I think it's time for number two
to become number one.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.074
He'll listen to you.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.874
-Don't say it.
-I wasn't going to.

00:06:45.249 --> 00:06:46.792
I shouldn't have dragged you out there.

00:06:46.876 --> 00:06:49.503
He wouldn't have flown me back.
She wouldn't have followed.

00:06:49.587 --> 00:06:51.088
-Yep.
-[frustrated grunt]

00:06:51.172 --> 00:06:54.091
I feel like the same screwup
I was before I met Toothless.

00:06:54.175 --> 00:06:55.676
I can see that.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.970
Are you just gonna stand there
and agree with everything?

00:06:58.054 --> 00:06:59.055
Well, you're right.

00:06:59.597 --> 00:07:01.265
You're back to where you started,

00:07:01.807 --> 00:07:04.352
but I was the first to believe in you.

00:07:04.435 --> 00:07:07.855
And I have watched you doubt
whether you're worthy ever since.

00:07:08.481 --> 00:07:09.523
But you know what?

00:07:10.232 --> 00:07:13.402
I am the person I am today because of you.

00:07:14.028 --> 00:07:16.989
I never told you that, but it's true.

00:07:17.156 --> 00:07:21.077
You are the bravest,
most stubborn, most determined

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:22.912
knucklehead I know.

00:07:23.663 --> 00:07:25.956
Toothless didn't give you that, Hiccup.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.708
He just made it...

00:07:27.792 --> 00:07:28.793
Easier.

00:07:29.502 --> 00:07:31.253
And now it's gonna be a lot harder.

00:07:32.922 --> 00:07:35.841
So, what are you gonna do about it?

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.095
Probably something stupid.

00:07:39.887 --> 00:07:41.847
That's the Hiccup I know.

